# Goal

$goal

## Context

Where the levers are (code, config, prompts, parameters, data), how to run things, and anything the agent has
to know to move the metric. Plain English.

## Constraints

- Rules the metric cannot see: keep the public API, no new dependencies, stay under N lines.

## Strategy hints

- Ideas or kinds of change worth trying first. Optional.

## Out of scope

- Things not to attempt even though they are inside `scope`.
